{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_depart", "introduces": [{"id": "axes", "type": "axes", "params": {"x": [-1, 5], "y": [-1, 10]}}, {"id": "courbe", "type": "function_graph", "params": {"expression": "x^2", "domain": [-1, 3.2]}, "style": {"role": "accent"}}, {"id": "fct", "type": "math", "content": "f(x) = x^2", "parts": [{"id": "ff", "text": "f(x) ="}, {"id": "xx", "text": "x^2"}], "layout": {"next_to": "axes", "direction": "right", "gap": "lg"}}, {"id": "A", "type": "point", "params": {"at": [1, 1]}}, {"id": "lab_A", "type": "label", "content": "A(1 ; 1)", "attachment": {"parent": "A", "anchor": "bottom"}}, {"id": "P", "type": "point", "params": {"at": [3, 9]}}, {"id": "lab_P", "type": "label", "content": "P(3 ; 9)", "attachment": {"parent": "P", "anchor": "left"}}, {"id": "secante", "type": "function_graph", "params": {"expression": "4*x - 3", "domain": [1, 3]}, "style": {"role": "given"}}], "beats": [{"id": "poser", "say": "Voici la courbe de f de x égale x au carré. On cherche la pente de la tangente au point A, où x vaut un.", "cues": [{"id": "c_courbe", "text": "f de x égale x au carré"}, {"id": "c_A", "text": "point A"}, {"id": "c_un", "text": "x vaut un"}], "do": [{"id": "s_axes", "verb": "show", "target": "axes", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "d_courbe", "verb": "draw", "target": "courbe", "start": "cue:c_courbe", "end": "cue_end:c_courbe"}, {"id": "s_A", "verb": "show", "target": "A", "at": "cue:c_A"}, {"id": "s_labA", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_A", "at": "after:s_A"}, {"id": "s_P", "verb": "show", "target": "P", "at": "cue:c_un"}, {"id": "s_labP", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_P", "at": "after:s_P"}, {"id": "w_ff", "verb": "write", "target": "fct", "part": "ff", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "w_xx", "verb": "write", "target": "fct", "part": "xx", "at": "cue:c_courbe"}]}, {"id": "secante", "say": "La droite qui passe par A et par P coupe la courbe en deux points : c'est une sécante. Sa pente se calcule avec la montée divisée par l'avancée.", "cues": [{"id": "c_secante", "text": "sécante"}, {"id": "c_pente", "text": "montée divisée par l'avancée"}], "do": [{"id": "d_sec", "verb": "draw", "target": "secante", "start": "cue:c_secante", "end": "cue_end:c_secante"}, {"id": "h_sec", "verb": "highlight", "target": "secante", "role": "given", "start": "cue:c_pente", "end": "cue_end:c_pente"}], "pause_after": "normal"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_pente_secante", "introduces": [{"id": "tri_h", "type": "line", "params": {"from": [1, 1], "to": [3, 1]}}, {"id": "tri_v", "type": "line", "params": {"from": [3, 1], "to": [3, 9]}}, {"id": "lab_av", "type": "label", "content": "avancée = 2", "attachment": {"parent": "tri_h", "anchor": "center", "placement": "outside"}}, {"id": "lab_mt", "type": "label", "content": "montée = 8", "attachment": {"parent": "tri_v", "anchor": "center", "placement": "outside"}}, {"id": "calc_pente", "type": "math", "content": "m = \\frac{9 - 1}{3 - 1} = \\frac{8}{2} = 4", "parts": [{"id": "m_eg", "text": "m ="}, {"id": "frac", "text": "\\frac{9 - 1}{3 - 1}"}, {"id": "res", "text": "= 4"}], "layout": {"next_to": "fct", "direction": "down", "gap": "lg"}}], "beats": [{"id": "triangle", "say": "Regarde le triangle de pente : l'avancée horizontale vaut deux, la montée verticale vaut huit.", "cues": [{"id": "c_tri", "text": "triangle de pente"}, {"id": "c_av", "text": "l'avancée"}, {"id": "c_mt", "text": "la montée"}], "do": [{"id": "d_h", "verb": "draw", "target": "tri_h", "start": "cue:c_av", "end": "cue_end:c_av"}, {"id": "s_labav", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_av", "at": "after:d_h"}, {"id": "d_v", "verb": "draw", "target": "tri_v", "start": "cue:c_mt", "end": "cue_end:c_mt"}, {"id": "s_labmt", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_mt", "at": "after:d_v"}]}, {"id": "calcul", "say": "La pente, c'est la montée divisée par l'avancée : huit divisé par deux, ça donne quatre.", "cues": [{"id": "c_mont", "text": "la montée divisée par l'avancée"}, {"id": "c_res", "text": "ça donne quatre"}], "do": [{"id": "w_m", "verb": "write", "target": "calc_pente", "part": "m_eg", "at": "cue:c_mont"}, {"id": "w_frac", "verb": "write", "target": "calc_pente", "part": "frac", "at": "after:w_m"}, {"id": "w_res", "verb": "write", "target": "calc_pente", "part": "res", "at": "cue:c_res"}, {"id": "h_res", "verb": "highlight", "target": "calc_pente", "part": "res", "role": "result", "at": "after:w