{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_rapproche", "introduces": [{"id": "sec2", "type": "function_graph", "params": {"expression": "3*x - 2", "domain": [1, 2]}, "style": {"role": "given"}}, {"id": "P2", "type": "point", "params": {"at": [2, 4]}, "frame": "axes"}, {"id": "lab_P2", "type": "label", "content": "P(2 ; 4)", "attachment": {"parent": "P2", "anchor": "right"}}, {"id": "calc_pente2", "type": "math", "content": "m = \\frac{4 - 1}{2 - 1} = 3", "parts": [{"id": "m2_eg", "text": "m ="}, {"id": "frac2", "text": "\\frac{4 - 1}{2 - 1}"}, {"id": "res2", "text": "= 3"}], "layout": {"next_to": "calc_pente", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}], "beats": [{"id": "approche", "say": "Maintenant, rapprochons P de A. Prenons P au point deux, quatre.", "cues": [{"id": "c_pp", "text": "P au point deux, quatre"}], "do": [{"id": "f_sec", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "secante", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "f_P", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "P", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "f_labP", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "lab_P", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "s_P2", "verb": "show", "target": "P2", "at": "cue:c_pp"}, {"id": "s_labP2", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_P2", "at": "after:s_P2"}, {"id": "d_sec2", "verb": "draw", "target": "sec2", "at": "cue:c_pp"}]}, {"id": "nouvelle_pente", "say": "La pente devient quatre moins un sur deux moins un, donc trois. Elle a baissé.", "cues": [{"id": "c_pente2", "text": "quatre moins un sur deux moins un"}, {"id": "c_trois", "text": "donc trois"}], "do": [{"id": "w_m2", "verb": "write", "target": "calc_pente2", "part": "m2_eg", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "w_frac2", "verb": "write", "target": "calc_pente2", "part": "frac2", "at": "cue:c_pente2"}, {"id": "w_res2", "verb": "write", "target": "calc_pente2", "part": "res2", "at": "cue:c_trois"}, {"id": "h_res2", "verb": "highlight", "target": "calc_pente2", "part": "res2", "role": "accent", "at": "after:w_res2"}], "pause_after": "normal"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_tangente", "introduces": [{"id": "tangente", "type": "function_graph", "params": {"expression": "2*x - 1", "domain": [0.2, 2.4]}, "style": {"role": "result"}}, {"id": "eq_tangente", "type": "math", "content": "y = 2x - 1", "parts": [{"id": "pente2", "text": "2x"}, {"id": "ord", "text": "- 1"}], "layout": {"next_to": "calc_pente2", "direction": "down", "gap": "lg"}}, {"id": "idee", "type": "text", "content": "La tangente, c'est la sécante limite : la pente 4 devient 2.", "layout": {"next_to": "eq_tangente", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}], "beats": [{"id": "tend", "say": "Si on continue à rapprocher P de A, la pente se rapproche de deux. C'est la tangente : la droite qui touche la courbe au point A.", "cues": [{"id": "c_deux", "text": "se rapproche de deux"}, {"id": "c_tangente", "text": "tangente"}], "do": [{"id": "f_sec2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "sec2", "at": "cue:c_deux"}, {"id": "f_P2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "P2", "at": "cue:c_deux"}, {"id": "f_labP2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "lab_P2", "at": "cue:c_deux"}, {"id": "d_tang", "verb": "draw", "target": "tangente", "start": "cue:c_tangente", "end": "cue_end:c_tangente"}]}, {"id": "equation", "say": "La tangente a une pente de deux et elle passe par A, donc son équation est y égale deux x moins un.", "cues": [{"id": "c_pente", "text": "pente de deux"}, {"id": "c_eq", "text": "y égale deux x moins un"}], "do": [{"id": "w_pente", "verb": "write", "target": "eq_tangente", "part": "pente2", "at": "cue:c_pente"}, {"id": "w_ord", "verb": "write", "target": "eq_tangente", "part": "ord", "at": "cue:c_eq"}, {"id": "h_eq", "verb": "highlight", "target": "eq_tangente", "role": "result", "at": "after:w_ord"}], "pause_after": "normal"}, {"id": "sens", "say": "En pratique, cette pente est un taux de variation instantané : c'est la vitesse à laquelle f change exactement au point A.", "cues": [{"id": "c_taux", "text": "taux de variation instantané"}], "do": [{"id": "s_idee", "verb": "